WEBVTT

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:05.910
Hello?

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:11.400
Ah, Katsura? About tomorrow, I think it's better if I head over there. We can go-

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.020
Katsura? You mean my sister?

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:18.160
Are you my sister's boyfriend?!

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.840
You're going on a date tomorrow?!

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:25.440
My sister is taking a bath right now to get ready for tomorrow!

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:26.870
Kokoro!

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:29.570
Sis!

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:09.750
Hey, Sis! I want to talk to him, too!

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:12.080
Just go away already.

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:14.740
He's the guy set as the background for your cell, right?

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:16.610
That's Itou-kun, right?

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:31.320
Katsura?

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:32.080
Yeah.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:35.620
I'm glad. She caught me by surprise.

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:37.910
I'm sorry, my sister...

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:39.860
Oh, that was your sister?

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:42.370
Yeah, her name is Kokoro.

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:45.630
Wow, both of you have unique names.

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:46.970
I guess so.

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:48.640
People tell us that a lot.

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:51.620
Well, I guess I'll call your sister Kokoro-chan from now on, then.

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:54.440
Okay.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:58.060
The name Katsura's sort of rare, as well. There's a lot of unusual names in your family.

00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:00.300
I guess so...

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:25.710
Itou-kun?

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:28.320
Wh-What is it?

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:31.150
Um, when my sister...

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:34.020
Oh, when Kokoro-chan picked up?

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:36.420
Don't worry about it at all!

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:37.820
Okay.

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:41.840
Well, actually...

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:45.620
She said she wanted to meet you.

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:49.360
Does that mean I get to go to your house?

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:53.770
Makoto, you're being too aggressive.

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:56.460
Really?

00:03:56.460 --> 00:04:00.750
I don't really mind that much...

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:03.550
See, Sekai? Katsura said it was okay!

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:09.400
Katsura-san, don't spoil him.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:11.080
That's not it...

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.210
This guy's already dense.

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:16.830
If you don't like the way something's going, just tell him no.

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:23.110
Um, Sekai-san, could I ask you not to interrupt us when things are going so well?

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:24.230
You-!

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.130
O-Ow.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:26.370
Take this.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.080
Sekai, that hurts!

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:37.670
Katsura, where did you go during lunch?

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:43.670
I had this pushed on me because you weren't here.

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:51.300
God, you're the one on the school fair panel. Giving me something like this is a pain.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:52.920
I'm sorry.

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:57.090
Maybe she went to see her boyfriend.

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:01.830
No, I...

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:04.020
So it was a guy!

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:07.020
It's no wonder that you always take off.

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:10.850
So what type of guy are you dating?

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:13.860
That's, um...

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:16.910
Not like it'd do us any good asking about him.

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:18.400
Well, yeah, but...

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:22.760
So what're you saying? That your boyfriend is more important than your position on the planning committee?

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:25.500
Huh? That's not it!

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.560
Then, get your act together.

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:28.690
Okay...

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:40.260
Then I'll leave the rest to you.

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:41.130
Okay.

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:41.890
Let's go.

00:05:41.890 --> 00:05:42.870
Okay.

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:55.170
Speaking of the school fair,
have you decided yet, Otome?

00:05:55.170 --> 00:06:00.380
Y-Yeah. But, it doesn't look like he's giving me the time of day.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.300
It's not like I have anything to lose, anyway.

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:05.100
Sounds like it's going well!

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:28.340
Katsura!

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:44.880
Did something happen?

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:48.440
You look sorta down.

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:50.330
I'm fine.

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:52.000
That's good, then...

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:59.090
Next up is Haramihama. Haramihama.

00:06:59.090 --> 00:07:00.610
Katsura...

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:03.130
If anything happened, feel free to tell me.

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:05.000
We're dating, after all.

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:06.830
Um...

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:11.280
We're really going out, right?

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.280
Of course.

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:27.630
Katsura...

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:35.650
Haramihama. Haramihama.

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:44.220
The doors are about the close. Please exercise caution.

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:05.270
I'm heading out!

00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:07.520
There we go...

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:12.980
1 Item Kuroda Hikari

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:15.390
Kind of looks like there's something going on between that quiet girl in Class 4 and your boyfriend.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:20.400
No, he's not my boyfriend.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:21.400
Mail Sent

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:30.260
Hello?

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:32.300
Makoto!

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:33.770
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:37.220
You gave Katsura-san trouble again, didn't you?

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:38.780
Huh? How so?

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:40.560
Don't give me "how so!"

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:43.400
You're the worst for putting your hands on her in public!

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:45.950
That's not how it was! We were just hugging.

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:47.820
How about taking the location into account?!

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:50.450
We're going out anyway. Who cares?

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:55.010
You know...

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:58.950
Not only can girls be shy, but there's also a little something called mood!

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:02.980
It's not like you can do anything you want with them anywhere you are!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:05.200
Even if you guys are dating...

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:06.200
Really?

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.760
Yes, really!

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:12.470
If you just keep pushing her to do all the stuff you want to do, she's just going to get mad again!

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:19.700
Listen up. If you want to do stuff like that, you have to think about how she feels and make it feel natural.

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:22.850
That's such a pain.

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:24.880
Well, that's what you're going to do!

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:26.430
Everyone else is doing that!

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:30.700
You've already gotten past the frustration of not understanding each other.

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:34.580
Now that you finally do, you're both supposed to be in lovey-dovey-land!

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:36.440
That's what dating is all about!

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:38.650
Are you sure?

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:40.170
Of course I'm sure!

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:43.270
In any event, apologize for what happened today.

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.620
Understand?

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:47.340
Do you understand?!

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:48.610
I got it.

00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:49.410
Later.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:51.000
Hey!

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:54.690
Jeez!

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:04.700
Anyway, I guess I need to apologize tomorrow.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:14.710
Haramihama. Haramihama.

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:23.560
We're about to depart. Please beware of the doors.

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:31.080
Huh? Katsura...

00:10:58.430 --> 00:11:00.210
Good morning, Makoto.

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:01.420
Morning...

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:03.020
What happened with Katsura-san?

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:06.950
She wasn't with me on the train.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:08.750
What are you doing?!

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:11.770
Go to Class 4 right now-

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:15.870
This is all because you wasted too much time!

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:19.970
Good lord, we're starting off with the married couple routine today?

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:30.340
First rub the cat skin with the ebonite rod, as in diagram 1,

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:35.610
and then place the rod near the leaf electrometer, and watch as the leaves open.

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:38.480
Next, grab the wire mesh by the handle...

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:07.270
You understand?

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:08.760
You'd better apologize.

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:12.580
Hey, Sekai, come with me.

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:15.960
If I go with you, it'll have the opposite effect.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.510
Really?

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:19.200
You're the one going out with her.

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:27.030
Sekai, Hikari and the others said they'd eat lunch with us today.

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:28.370
Oh, really?

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:30.260
I guess I should every once in a while.

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:34.750
So, that's that. Go for it.

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:44.770
What are you smiling about?

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:48.190
We thought it was about time to ask about the school fair.

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:50.420
So Otome will get the guy she likes!

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:51.810
Stop it.

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:53.970
Otome's so cute.

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:11.350
Katsura...

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:34.320
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:36.910
I told you he was bad news!

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:38.840
No, that's not...

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:42.770
You'll just end up depressed if you hang around a guy like that.

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:44.850
You've got it all wrong...

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:50.250
So you haven't been hanging out with us much because of Itou?

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:53.590
No, Makoto doesn't have anything to do with it. Really.

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:55.080
So you two are on a first name basis?

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:57.370
You can just feel the love.

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:59.860
That's because we sit next to each other and stuff...

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:05.170
It really is his fault. He's used the seat change as a chance to hit on you.

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:07.100
I keep telling you that it's not like that!

00:14:07.100 --> 00:14:11.080
The school fair is getting close, so it's like this all over.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.090
Really?

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:16.810
You know how it is. The girls and guys that go around the fair become couples.

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:19.630
Some of the faster ones are already on top of each other.

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:21.540
Really?

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:23.180
The school fair...

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:25.750
How are the preparations going, President?

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:30.250
Our class will have to decide what it wants to do soon, too.

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:31.430
I see.

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:34.400
I wonder what we'll be doing.

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:36.610
It'll just be picked through a vote, anyway.

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:39.010
I hope it ends up being something easy.

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:42.850
The standard is doing a café or a haunted house.

00:14:43.760 --> 00:14:46.630
Both sound like too much work.

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:01.990
Listen...

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:04.590
Um...

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:07.090
Katsura, are you still mad?

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:10.510
I mean, for what I did on the train yesterday.

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:15.080
Katsura...

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:21.290
No. Don't worry about it.

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:23.520
Uh, are you sure?

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:33.140
Oh, yeah. You said something about Kokoro-chan?

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:35.140
Yeah.

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:37.090
I can go today if you want.

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:40.840
It'd be a bit too much to handle today...

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:42.310
Yeah, you're right.

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:43.490
Sorry.

00:15:47.950 --> 00:15:49.340
Um...

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:50.520
What is it?

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:52.610
How about Sunday?

00:15:53.210 --> 00:15:54.160
Really?

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:55.910
Yes, of course.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.430
I'll go!

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:01.970
How far is your house from the train station?

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:05.030
Um, walking... It would be...

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:06.520
I'm excited!

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:08.310
I wonder what I should wear.

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:11.150
Maybe I'll go out and buy something new!

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:12.780
How does that sound?

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:25.090
Welcome!

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:27.620
Huh?

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:35.130
You don't come by that often.

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:36.580
Am I bugging you?

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:37.790
Not at all.

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:39.420
Things were getting slow.

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:40.440
That's good.

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:42.370
What is it?

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:45.160
Just came to see you for a bit.

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:46.380
All this way?

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:48.380
It happens sometimes.

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:50.050
You're silly.

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:55.410
I get off in an hour. Wanna go home together?

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.160
Sure.

00:16:56.650 --> 00:17:00.400
So, what will you have, Ms. Setsuna.

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:12.630
I'll have the limited time shiratama anmitsu dessert topped with maccha. Iced coffee for the drink, no sugar.

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:20.520
Sorry for making you wait.

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:21.520
It's fine.

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:24.760
So what's up? What's really bugging you?

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:29.650
Jeez, how many years have we known each other for?

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:34.890
Then I'll ask you...

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:38.320
Are you really not dating Itou?

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:39.430
I'm not.

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:40.540
Really?

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:42.130
It's true!

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:47.150
You thought that too?

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:49.540
That's not it...

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:52.500
There's nothing going on with Makoto.

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:04.160
I understand.

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:05.090
Okay.

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:26.470
Well, it's good that you got invited!

00:18:27.090 --> 00:18:30.440
Me? I have work that day.

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:35.500
I'll be praying for your happiness while I'm working all by myself.

00:18:46.630 --> 00:18:48.960
Wow! It's the real thing!

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:49.640
Hey!

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:50.750
Kokoro!

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:53.570
Let's have fun, big brother!

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:55.930
B-Big brother?!

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:31.360
Kokoro-chan, you don't hold back, do you?

00:19:31.360 --> 00:19:35.080
Itou-kun, would you like lemon or milk?

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:37.250
Milk's fine.

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:41.110
Sorry that Kokoro played around so much.

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.650
It's okay.

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:44.570
Thank you, Katsura.

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:47.160
Hey, big brother?

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:48.100
What is it?

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:52.600
Why do you call my sister "Katsura"?

00:20:13.590 --> 00:20:17.320
I'm sorry that Kokoro said something so weird.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:23.860
No, I'm sorry. I didn't even think that something like that would be on your mind.

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:35.340
Is what I call you really that important?

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:37.140
It is!

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:40.550
Um, Katsura?

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:42.710
I-I'm sorry.

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:44.370
Don't worry about it.

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:47.830
Then...

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:50.060
Kotonoha?

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:55.320
Kind of makes you blush.

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:57.360
It makes me happy.

00:20:57.360 --> 00:21:00.070
R-Really?

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:02.110
U-Um...

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:03.310
Yeah?

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:07.670
Makoto-kun...

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:09.550
It's my name!

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:17.650
It kind of finally feels like we're a real couple.

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:19.150
Yes.

00:21:19.150 --> 00:21:21.160
Yeah, I'm glad.

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:33.780
The train will be arriving soon.
Please wait behind the white line.

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:35.740
Well, then...

00:21:35.740 --> 00:21:36.600
Yeah.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:42.690
Makoto-kun.

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:44.340
What is it?

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:49.370
Could you close your eyes for a bit?

00:21:52.260 --> 00:21:53.540
Like this?

00:22:18.360 --> 00:22:20.030
Good night.

00:22:20.950 --> 00:22:23.350
The train will be departing soon.

00:22:23.350 --> 00:22:25.570
Please beware of the closing doors.

00:22:34.260 --> 00:22:36.260
So it went well, huh?

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:39.990
I guess. There really wasn't that much to it.

00:22:39.990 --> 00:22:43.180
What are you saying? You looked like you were going to cry before.

00:22:44.280 --> 00:22:47.710
I guess it looks like your relationship has finally gotten going.

00:22:48.240 --> 00:22:49.510
Keep going for it.

00:22:51.180 --> 00:22:52.770
Going, eh?

00:22:52.770 --> 00:22:54.840
Yep. Going.

00:22:55.320 --> 00:22:57.030
Hey, Sekai...

00:22:57.980 --> 00:23:05.010
I'm kind of getting tired of spending time with Kotonoha.

00:24:47.080 --> 00:24:54.000
Next Time
Innocence
